<%--
View_Section_Abstract - section/card chrome base (background, border, radius, shadow)

The single home of section/card chrome. Concrete children (Section, Card_Widget,
Detail_Sidebar) re-parent this base via body-preserving extends= and render their
own template; the base contributes only its class (and therefore its chrome) to
the shared root. Never used directly as a tag.

Reskinning the app's card look is one edit here.
--%>
<Define:View_Section_Abstract>
    <%= content() %>
</Define:View_Section_Abstract>
